# One line-ending rule for every client. Windows git (incl. SourceTree's bundled
# git) runs with core.autocrlf=true and checked files out as CRLF, which WSL git
# then reported as whole-file modifications (88 files, found 2026-10-21). An
# attribute overrides autocrlf, so both sides now store and check out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
